1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,999
Praise the Lord, my name is Dona Saju, I am a member of St. George Forane, Chemperi in Kannur district, first of all,

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,999
a thousand thanks to Jesus and Mother Mary for giving me the opportunity to share this testimony, I am a witness to the apparition of Our Lady of Kreupasanam.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,999
I took the Covenant for the first time on May 20th, 2025, the reason for taking the Covenant is that in my normal day-to-day life, I am a person who prays a lot.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,999
Or I would always pray to Jesus and I would pray to the Holy Spirit.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,999
I used to pray mostly to Father Jesus, while studying for my EC, I used to sleep hugging the statue of Father Jesus.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,999
But I was not someone who prayed to Mother Mary like that.

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,999
It's not that I didn't like her, but I didn't have an inner devotion to Mother Mary, that's why I didn't pray to her.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,999
Then suddenly one day I had a feeling that I should take the Covenant, and if so, I could pray the Rosary daily.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,999
That desire suddenly came to me, I'll tell you how I came to the Covenant, but before that,

10
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,999
even before taking the Covenant, I started receiving many Marian presences, that is, I took the Covenant as a first pilgrim.

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,999
At that time I was studying German in Mysore, so for the first two or three days, I normally sat on my bed and prayed the Rosary.

12
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,999
Then suddenly on the fourth or fifth day, I felt that since I am praying the Rosary anyway,

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:28,999
I should light a candle, kneel down, open my hands, and pray the Rosary.

14
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,999
So the very next day I went to the shop and bought our normal white candles.

15
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,999
There is a small prayer hall in the apartment where I live, so I went there, lit the candle, and started praying.

16
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:44,999
By the time I reached the fourth mystery, I saw the candle burning brightly.

17
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,999
After a while, when I looked, there was a huge heart shape, and I was very happy, immediately I went out and called my friends.

18
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:56,999
They all came and took photos on their phones, and the next day I waited for evening to come.

19
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:02,999
In the evening, when I prayed the Rosary, I saw a beautiful flower appearing while praying, which was great.

20
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,999
The next day evening I waited inside, and when I prayed, first a flower came, and from behind another flower came.

21
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:14,999
The next day when I prayed the Rosary, there was a big flower, and in the middle of it a white Mother Mary.

22
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:21,999
If you ask which Mother Mary, it was a Mother Mary like the one at our counter number 13, and it started coming to me daily like that.

23
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,999
Almost my phone storage became completely full with photos.

24
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:32,999
Since my phone was full, I created a folder in Google Drive for Our Lady of Kreupasanam and started saving all the photos in it.

25
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:39,999
Later I started a page on Instagram called Divine Miracles and started saving all these photos in it.

26
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,999
Then there was another Marian presence, that is, on December 7th I really wanted to come here but I couldn't.

27
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:51,999
So I thought, since I couldn't, on that day I would decorate a photo of Our Lady of Kreupasanam in my room.

28
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:00,999
So by 2 o'clock I started praying the Rosary, and by 2:30 I lit a blue candle and started praying the Apparition Prayer of Our Lady of Kreupasanam.

29
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:06,999
After a while, the candle suddenly started burning brightly, so I thought maybe a flower or heart was going to come anyway.

30
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,999
But it wasn't like that, a statue of Mother Mary appeared on the side of the candle.

31
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,999
So on December 7th at 2:30 in the afternoon, Mother Mary came in the candle, and I was very happy.

32
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:22,999
Mother Mary has come to me many times, last January a big statue of Mother Mary came, that day Mother Mary even closed her eyes on the candle.

33
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:28,999
After that, a silver-grey Mother Mary has appeared in the green candle many times.

34
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:34,999
So I have received many Marian presences, similarly, there was another Marian presence while I was in Thiruvalla.

35
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:40,999
While studying German, I was sleeping hugging a statue of Mother Mary, around 5:20 in the daytime.

36
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:46,999
Someone came and gave me a single slap with a hand, I was really shocked, there was no one there to hit me.

37
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:54,999
My friend was there, she lived slightly away in the room, I am a heavy sleeper, and I get very angry if someone disturbs me in my sleep.

38
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,999
So I immediately closed my eyes and went back to sleep.

39
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:03,999
After a while, a hand came and held my stomach, or rather, a hand came and held me in a hugging manner.

40
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:08,999
I woke up startled, and when I looked at the time it was 5:30.

41
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:14,999
Mother Mary had called me for prayer, so at 5:30 I prayed the Apparition Prayer, and I usually go to church daily.

42
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:19,999
After that, I went to church and prayed, receiving many Marian presences.

43
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,999
And similarly, I had received the Anointing of Fragrance many times.

44
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:32,999
Last January 26th, I went to a care home to do acts of mercy, as I go most weeks, and after doing ministry there, I came out.

45
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:40,999
It was very sunny, I prayed the Apostles' Creed and said, "Mother, I have 56 papers in my hand, I don't know how I will finish distributing them."

46
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:47,999
I asked her to bring deserving people in front of me, and suddenly there was the scent of jasmine flowers for about 5 minutes.

47
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:51,999
That day itself I was able to finish distributing the 56 papers.

48
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:57,999
Similarly, while studying German, when I came to the convent, I was studying on the terrace.

49
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:04,999
At that time a friend called and asked me how I manage to do acts of mercy and apostolic work.

50
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:10,999
While I was explaining everything to her in detail, suddenly the scent of jasmine flowers came, which also lasted for almost five minutes.

51
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:14,999
I have received many Marian presences in my life.

52
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:19,999
Thus, Mother Mary blessed me with a great grace to pray the Rosary, I who never used to pray it.

53
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:25,999
This is my first testimony, my second testimony is that after completing nursing, I had a desire to study German.

54
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:30,999
But in my life, whatever decision I make, I only do it after asking Mother Mary.

55
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:36,999
So one day, while attending a retreat, having confessed and being in a good spirit, I took the Bible.

56
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:45,999
I asked Jesus, "Jesus, should I go study German or not?" and when I opened the Bible, I got Luke 8:48, "Daughter, your faith has saved you, go in peace."

57
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:51,999
So Jesus told me to go, and on that basis, I went to study German in Mysore.

58
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:58,999
I had a desire to go to church daily, so I asked the warden, "Ma'am, I desire to go to church daily, do I have permission?"

59
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:03,999
She said no, only if the manager of the institute gives permission, you can go to church daily.

60
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:08,999
So I wrote a letter to the manager, and he agreed and told me I could go to church daily.

61
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:13,999
Thus, along with two friends, we would go to church daily.

62
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:17,999
Even though I was going to church, I didn't pray the Rosary.

63
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:21,999
When I reached Mysore, I prayed the Rosary for two or three days, and then I stopped.

64
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:28,999
By the first week of May, I started feeling very sad, thinking, "I am unable to pray the Rosary, what do I do now?"

65
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:33,999
I thought if I take the Covenant, I can pray the Rosary, and this thought came in the first week.

66
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:38,999
But if I were to take the Covenant, when would it be possible? I didn't have the situation or circumstances because my institute was very strict.

67
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:47,999
So I told my mummy, "Mummy, I desire to take the Covenant," and mummy said, "If Mother Mary has prepared it for you, she will set the time for you."

68
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:52,999
By the second week of May, I had my A2 exam.

69
00:06:53,000 --> 00:07:01,999
Usually, they conduct all A2 exams on Fridays, giving us Saturday and Sunday off, and resuming classes on Monday.

70
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:06,999
That's the usual practice, and my A2 exam was on a Friday.

71
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:11,999
By evening, the results were announced, and the manager came and said, "You have been granted a week's leave."

72
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:18,999
Actually, we initially thought they were tricking us, but later we realized they had truly given us a week's leave.

73
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:23,999
Everyone at the institute was shocked because nobody had ever been given a week's leave before.

74
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:29,999
Then my mommy told me, "Mother Mary gave you the time to take the Covenant," and that is how I took the Covenant here last year on May 20th.

75
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:35,999
After that, when I went to Mysore and started praying, Mother Mary started giving me the heart and flower.

76
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:43,999
Mother Mary gave me a great grace to pray the Rosary like that, and this is my first testimony, I mean second testimony.

77
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:49,999
My second testimony is also from my time studying in Mysore, where after a while, many problems started arising.

78
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:54,999
When many people started dropping out, I asked Mother Mary, "Mother, should I drop out of the institute?"

79
00:07:55,000 --> 00:08:01,999
I told Mother Mary, "If I should leave, give me a flower in the candle, and if I should stay there, give me a heart."

80
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:07,999
By the third mystery, I saw a beautiful flower, so I understood that I was indeed supposed to leave the institute.

81
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:17,999
That same day I found a new institute, but the accommodation wasn't sorted out. Surrendering all that to Mother Mary, my friend and I traveled to Thiruvalla.

82
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:26,999
When we reached Thiruvalla, we were told the institute's hostel was full, and there was a convent, but we weren't interested in it.

83
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:34,999
Because there was only one common plug for ironing and charging, we weren't very keen on it.

84
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:40,999
So from morning till evening, we wandered around looking for PGs, but nothing worked out.

85
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:47,999
By evening, I told my friend, "It doesn't matter, we can go and stay at the convent itself, it's only for a short time."

86
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:56,999
So she agreed, and we went back to the convent and asked the sister, "Sister, we need a room."

87
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:00,999
She said there was a dormitory available and only one room left.

88
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:05,999
We said okay and that we would take that room, so the sister took us to that room.

89
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,999
When we opened the door, there was a large photo of Our Lady of Kreupasanam on the shelf.

90
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:16,999
Then we understood that it was Mother Mary who had brought us there, and our stay in Thiruvalla was awesome.

91
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:22,999
After that, on November 4th, I booked the slot for my first B2 exam in Bangalore.

92
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:28,999
My friend and I wrote the exam in Bangalore, and everyone studying German knows about the codes and things involved.

93
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:34,999
But during that exam, they didn't ask me for any codes, and I was very sad; I had used the holy oil.

94
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:41,999
Using Kreupasanam salt, I prayed the Apostles' Creed, surrendered to Mother Mary, and wrote the exam.

95
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:47,999
When we came out after the exam, everyone said they had code, but nothing happened to me alone.

96
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,999
I felt very sad, and after that, I thought I would do the speaking exam brilliantly.

97
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:56,999
But my partner was not cooperating with me in any way, so I became completely devastated, but then I thought it doesn't matter.

98
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:01,999
Daily when I pray the Rosary, I always get a heart without missing a single day.

99
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:06,999
And Mother Mary, a silver-grey Mother Mary, frequently appears to me.

100
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:12,999
So I thought it's okay, Mother Mary will help me pass the exam, and on November 30th I had a big dream.

101
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:17,999
That is, a big screen, and in front of the screen my friend and I were standing.

102
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:23,999
It showed a 'fail' next to me, and it showed my friend passing by one mark from there.

103
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:28,999
I woke up startled, and when I checked the time it was 2:55 AM, and in the morning I went to church.

104
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:35,999
After everything, this dream kept coming to my mind, and by 3 PM in the afternoon, I prayed the Divine Mercy Rosary.

105
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:41,999
When I prayed that Rosary, Mother Mary gave me a beautiful heart, so I understood that since Mother Mary is with me, there is no problem.

106
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:48,999
That evening by 4 PM, my friend called and said the result was announced and asked me to check the mail.

107
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:53,999
When I checked, I had failed full modules, and my friend passed by one mark.

108
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:58,999
It was very hard for me to accept it suddenly because when I studied in college, I was a college topper.

109
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:02,999
Since I never had failure in my life like that, I became suddenly very sad.

110
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:11,999
The next day when I attended the Covenant Retreat, Father had mentioned inside. He said that those who follow the Covenant faithfully might not have signs in the early days.

111
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:16,999
Because God knows that no matter how much failure and sorrow is given to them, they will not leave God.

112
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:21,999
When Father said that this is why we face failures, it struck me hard, and I sat there happily.

113
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:28,999
On the very day I failed, I got a center to book the next date in Kochi.

114
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:34,999
The exam was on December 9th; the first exam was on a Tuesday, and the second exam I got was also on a Tuesday.

115
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:40,999
So I attended the exam using the salt and oil as before, and one day I had a dream.

116
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:45,999
I dreamed that I failed the whole exam, and the next day I dreamed that I passed the whole exam.

117
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:51,999
By the first week of January, the results came out, and I passed three modules and failed one module.

118
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:59,999
I was happy thinking, "No problem, I got three modules," so I thought I would book a slot only for speaking.

119
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,999
I had attended the TELC exam, and when I looked, I had to pay the same rate as the full module even for just speaking.

120
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:10,999
I felt very sad because I had to pay almost the full amount of 23000 in Kollam.

121
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:16,999
I told Mother Mary, "Failing a full module and failing this one module ended up costing the same."

122
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:22,999
So there was a center near the place where I live, but they only had full modules.

123
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:28,999
They didn't have partial module exams there, so that day I called them and asked, "Ma'am, can I attend the partial module just for speaking?"

124
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:35,999
She said, "No, the slot isn't open yet; if it opens, just keep checking the website occasionally, it will show on the website."

125
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:42,999
The next day I made up my mind to book it in Kollam, but suddenly my Papa told me, "Just check the website casually."

126
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:47,999
He said, "Maybe it might open," and suddenly the speaking slot opened there.

127
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:53,999
And it only cost 9,500 rupees, so I immediately booked the very first date.

128
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:59,999
After booking, when I checked the day, it was a Tuesday, and the reporting time was at 2:30.

129
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:04,999
I wrote the first exam on Tuesday, the second exam on Tuesday, and the third exam on Tuesday.

130
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:09,999
I didn't plan any of these exams for Tuesday, but when I booked them, they ended up falling on Tuesdays.

131
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:14,999
For the third exam, I left my house and traveled to that center after applying the Covenant salt and praying.

132
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:19,999
I didn't particularly study anything; I completely surrendered it to Mother Mary.

133
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:25,999
By February 10th, I got an email saying Mother Mary had blessed me with 73 marks out of 75.

134
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:31,999
That was on February 10th, meaning the decision I prayed for was on February 10th last year.

135
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:35,999
The word of God I received was, "Daughter, your faith has saved you, go in peace."

136
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:41,999
From February last year to February this year, I passed all the complete modules.

137
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:45,999
Thus, I give a thousand thanks to Mother Mary and Jesus.

138
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:50,999
This is my next testimony, and after that, I got my driving license on the first attempt.

139
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:55,999
That is, around late January, I went to take my driving license.

140
00:13:56,000 --> 00:14:00,999
The day before the test drive, I had a severe fever, cold, and cough.

141
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:05,999
By the next morning, I also got my periods, and I felt so unwell I didn't know what to do.

142
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:10,999
When I reached there, I sprinkled salt on the ground and prayed, and I sprinkled salt in the car and prayed.

143
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:17,999
First was the 'H' test; the 'H' on one side was fine, but when I came to the next side, I hit the ribbon and the pole a bit.

144
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:26,999
Realizing I had failed anyway, I reversed back, and as I started getting out of the car, the sir who taught me came to me.

145
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:31,999
He said, "Daughter, all these days you drove beautifully, what have you done today?"

146
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:36,999
He added, "Since you are unwell, I won't say anything," and walked away, which made me very sad.

147
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:42,999
Immediately I went out and approached the policeman, and the policeman smiled widely at me, I don't know why he smiled so much.

148
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:46,999
Then he asked me if I was a nurse, and I said yes, I am a nurse.

149
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:52,999
Then he gave me that paper and told me to go, and the sir who taught me came to me and asked, "Daughter, what is this you've done?"

150
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:56,999
I told him, "Sir, I don't know anything because I am unwell."

151
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:00,999
He said, "That policeman must have felt some pity and passed you."

152
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,999
So I passed like that, and to tell the truth, I don't know how I passed.

153
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:07,999
Because I had broken the rules; usually everyone who hits that pole is failed there.

154
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:13,999
He had only kept me passed, and similarly, there were some mistakes while driving on the road too.

155
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:20,999
But by the grace of Mother Mary, the policeman passed me on that as well, and this is my testimony.

156
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:24,999
Similarly, I have done many acts of mercy and apostolic works.

157
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:31,999
When I was in Mysore, acts of mercy are highly restricted there because Karnataka has many restrictions.

158
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:38,999
When I checked Google, I saw many care homes and things, and I found a center called Ayushman Health Care in Mysore.

159
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:42,999
So my two friends and I bravely took an Uber and went there.

160
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:50,999
There were many nurses standing in front, and they said, "You are not allowed here, there are no permissions, nobody will let you in."

161
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:57,999
I felt very sad, and then this woman called some manager and told the manager to give the phone to those kids.

162
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:04,999
She gave me the phone, and the manager asked, "Where are you from? There are no permissions here, turn around and go back."

163
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:11,999
So I said, "Sir, we want to do social service every Sunday, just for 3 hours."

164
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:18,999
The sir replied, "If so, come to our office," and gave us the location of the office, but it took an hour to reach there.

165
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:25,999
When we arrived, he was sitting there wearing a coat and suit; he made us stand to the side and asked for our self-introductions.

166
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:32,999
I became very tense; he gave us a piece of paper and told us to write a letter, saying we needed to show it to the manager, and scared us a lot.

167
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:41,999
I felt like we had walked into a mess, and after a while, someone walked into my room, and it was my friend.

168
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:47,999
I immediately saw him and asked, "What are you doing here?" and he asked me the same thing.

169
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:51,999
He called me to the side and asked why I was standing there.

170
00:16:52,000 --> 00:17:00,999
I told him, "Dude, I desire to do social service on Sundays, but sir isn't giving permission, they say they need high authority permissions."

171
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:05,999
He said, "No problem, I am the nursing officer here, I'll set everything up for you."

172
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:10,999
He made a phone call, sorted everything out, and took us to the care home right on the spot.

173
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:17,999
He introduced us to everyone there, and the nurses who had chased us away were bewildered.

174
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:22,999
Because they had chased us kids away, and then we came back again, that too with the nursing officer.

175
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:27,999
So he introduced us to everyone, and we started going there every Sunday.

176
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:33,999
The day after granting this permission, he resigned and left from there because he got another promotion.

177
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:38,999
He came there like an angel, got us all the permissions, and then left.

178
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:44,999
So when I came to Mysore, I would go there every Sunday to help them, giving them music therapy and dance therapy.

179
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:49,999
Also, while I was in Thiruvalla, there were some handicapped children.

180
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:57,999
We used to visit them most Sundays, and now when I sit free at home, there is an old age home in my hometown.

181
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:01,999
I go there every week, and I bathe the grandfathers and grandmothers.

182
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:05,999
I wash their clothes, cut their nails, and feed them food.

183
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:10,999
Since I am a nurse, I check their blood pressure and sugar levels properly on a schedule.

184
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:13,999
Thus, they are very happy, and I am also very happy.

185
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:17,999
Similarly, I do a lot of apostolic work; for example, when I walk on the street,

186
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:23,999
if I see Kreupasanam papers torn and thrown away on the street, I pick them all up and keep them safe.

187
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:27,999
I have found many Kreupasanam papers in dustbins, and I safely keep them.

188
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:33,999
Also, when I go to church, if there's a set of papers just lying there, I take them and distribute them to everyone.

189
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:39,999
Similarly, I share Father's Covenant Retreat and daily bread videos with everyone.

190
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:46,999
And since I really have a lot of photos of Mother Mary and Jesus on my phone, I show them to everyone, telling them Mother Mary gave them to me.

191
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:51,999
In this way, many people's faith began to increase, and many people have come here and taken the Covenant.

192
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:55,999
I give a thousand thanks to Jesus and Mother Mary who gave me so many blessings.

193
00:18:56,000 --> 00:19:06,999
Sirach 11:17: "The Lord’s gift remains with the devout, and his favor brings lasting success."

194
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:16,999
In this radiant Marian Covenant testimony of this daughter named Dona Saju, what we just heard entirely,

195
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:22,999
is about how much this daughter loved and lived the Covenant.

196
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:34,999
The Marian Covenant carries us in the palm of her hand, providing the blessings and experiences of life, constantly reminding us, "I am with you."

197
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:39,999
Dear ones, are we in the Covenant? Do we have the innocence of the Covenant in our lives?

198
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:50,999
Mother Mary will seamlessly help our lives without ever leaving us, as beautifully marked by those Marian presences the daughter shared in this testimony.

199
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:57,999
The daughter said, "I applied for my exams without choosing any specific day, date, or time."

200
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:02,999
"But Mother Mary consistently granted them to me on Tuesdays."

201
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:10,999
The daughter shares at this altar how beautifully the presence of Mother Mary helped her to deepen her life in the Covenant.

202
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:20,999
And through the Covenant, to achieve victories and move forward with spiritual strength during failures.

203
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:32,999
Let us offer this testimony with applause, thanking Mother Mary and the Holy Son for all the divine experiences, victories, and spiritual convictions this daughter has received.

